{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：23:11 2026-11-26 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"屯門工廈「萬能閣」297萬推拍 業主盤蝕讓拍賣兼「大放送」豪花80萬裝修 空間感十足\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d42b2d3c80e10062aa27081cc1eb3813/2026-11/f988451b-98c3-4d41-bdba-d7993eee4e0e.jpg\"/>\n<p>屯門工廈「萬能閣」一個低層單位將於下周拍賣，建築面積約983方呎，開價僅297萬元，呎價約3,021元。該業主盤可謂「蝕讓兼大放送」，業主今年4月才以320萬元買入，更豪擲約80萬元翻新，將單位打造成「美輪美奐」的空間。是次開價不僅較半年前的買入價低23萬元（約7%），更較銀行估價360萬元足足低水63萬元（約18%），相當於「買樓送豪裝」再蝕讓離場。</p>\n<h3>「萬能閣」低層單位：</h3>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9e5582081bb851e383cf13853245abdf/2026-11/I1_0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1ffc41799e2bf99c532ea208f1f41cd5/2026-11/I2.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f5c403c99dfabe9906c9ffd52c40db48/2026-11/I3.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6a2b527daa84ee4d6fe0c8bbc3214ebd/2026-11/I4_0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/63d8cec4b1d65700528e679c928ac336/2026-11/I5.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/edc2d4b6bab6df0d24ab228ff184bc4b/2026-11/I6.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/de5bb864a3159a3b56cb22e218d524f1/2026-11/I7.jpg\"/>\n<p>從現場相片可見，單位內籠極具氣派，各式家電、廚櫃及沙發等家具一應俱全，空間感十足，裝修精緻得宛如私樓豪宅，完全擺脫傳統工廈的印象。該物業將於12月2日（星期三）由忠誠拍賣行推出拍賣。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T15:23:54.153607+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":306,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T15:11:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T16:17:50.415687+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T15:17:24.887880+00:00","content_hash":"d8097d4517502a56ed9a1ffa47f5bba4d863cdf68b8c3355c0796155055b3085","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}